Z||000000||kinboyatuwo||11-21-2000||07:43 PM||||Read the thred on the viper challenge, just wondering the same for a stock or lightly mod 5.0?  Thats all i want to do, show all the mustang boyz what to drive:-)||||reg||1
Z||000001||lou_dias||11-22-2000||12:32 PM||||No stock or slightly modified Mustang 5.0 has kept up with me after 110mph...  My races have been on the highway from 80-130 mph.  Mustangs have a lousy 5th gear.<P>I dog them off the line too...<P>I have a rebuilt 3.4 block on ported heads and intake...with a 5spd...  My car dynoed at 146.3 hp at the wheels from 4200-5000rpm.<BR>Figure it's 180hp gross estimated.  Can't wait to turbo it.||||reg||1
Z||000002||GT Bastard||11-22-2000||01:40 PM||||My friend has an '86SE 4sp with a 3.1 out of a minivan(unmodified) and I witnessed him destroy a 90LX 5.0 5sp.  We're friends with the owner of the Stang and he was ashamed. Part of that vicotry was excessive wheelspin on the 5.0's part though.  <P>I haven't raced a 5.0 in my car, but I utterly humiliated some punk in a 98ish Mustang 4.6 GT with an automatic.  HE provoked the race, not me.  I didn't think he was actually racing until I hear the tires squeal, and I STILL beat him through the light.  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||BBBAD GT||11-22-2000||10:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by lou_dias:<BR><B>Mustangs have a lousy 5th gear.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Who races in Overdrive?  You won't see many Mustangs that race from 80-130, mainly because the die-hard Stangs that race from stoplight to stoplight have the ET Streets for tires (slicks with tiny grooves to be DOT legal), and they aren't the most stable tires at 80+.<BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
Z||000004||lou_dias||11-24-2000||09:10 AM||||Actually I see lots of them race on the highway.  We have a highway here that's pretty straight and long.<P>Before my new engine went in, I had a poor running 3.3 (as opposed to my smooth 3.5) and I would get beat consistently, but not by much to Mustangs, now I beat them by the same difference.  I see them alot on the way into Providence on the weekends.... Young kids on the way to night clubs + Mustangs on the highway = lots of races to Providence.||||reg||1
